{"id":"n64677-4-7","stage":1,"title":"마르다 · 渴","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64677-4-7-1","ko":"목이 마른데 시원한 물 한 잔만 주세요.","zh":"我口渴了，能给我一杯冰水吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"목이","meaning":"喉咙，嗓子，咽喉","explanation":"목：喉咙，嗓子，咽喉；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"목","audio":"/audio/5fbc9add7bd4911bb918.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89861","senseId":"2","lemma":"목","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"목이","audio":"/audio/12ba5841dcaa9b5a4d16.mp3"}},{"text":"마른데","meaning":"渴，口干","explanation":"마르다：渴，口干；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"마르다","audio":"/audio/6cd2f7184df80453aa2c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64677","senseId":"4","lemma":"마르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마른데","audio":"/audio/0f95a63824ba62f0fe73.mp3"}},{"text":"시원한","meaning":"爽口，清爽","explanation":"시원하다：爽口，清爽；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"시원하다","audio":"/audio/a1a23b7fbec5dd69c7b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71281","senseId":"2","lemma":"시원하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시원한","audio":"/audio/eb75ec9a411a296929cc.mp3"}},{"text":"물","meaning":"水","explanation":"물：水","readings":[{"term":"물","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17596","senseId":"1","lemma":"물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3"}},{"text":"한","meaning":"一个，同一","explanation":"한：一个，同一","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"4","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}},{"text":"잔만","meaning":"杯","explanation":"잔：杯；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"잔","audio":"/audio/ca06065856b9c29b0c80.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17371","senseId":"3","lemma":"잔","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잔만","audio":"/audio/2823c9cc7ca5df0b2e7a.mp3"}},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"给予，给","explanation":"주다：给予，给；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주세요","audio":"/audio/97f2a1d4f468faba426d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5fbc9add7bd4911b","term":"목","zh":"喉咙，嗓子，咽喉","audio":"/audio/5fbc9add7bd4911bb918.mp3","entryId":"89861","definition":"在脖子内部通向体内的深深的洞。","pronunciation":["목"]},{"id":"6cd2f7184df80453","term":"마르다","zh":"渴，口干","audio":"/audio/6cd2f7184df80453aa2c.mp3","entryId":"64677","definition":"嘴里或嗓子里唾液变少因而想喝水。","pronunciation":["마르다"]},{"id":"a1a23b7fbec5dd69","term":"시원하다","zh":"爽口，清爽","audio":"/audio/a1a23b7fbec5dd69c7b5.mp3","entryId":"71281","definition":"食物冰凉爽快、正合胃口，或热乎得让人畅快淋漓。","pronunciation":["시원하다"]},{"id":"2e7edc957ce601f5","term":"물","zh":"水","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3","entryId":"17596","definition":"含在河、湖、海、地下水等，纯粹的且无色无香无味的透明液体。","pronunciation":["물"]},{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"一个，同一","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"73278","definition":"同一个。","pronunciation":["한"]},{"id":"ca06065856b9c29b","term":"잔","zh":"杯","audio":"/audio/ca06065856b9c29b0c80.mp3","entryId":"17371","definition":"以盛饮料、酒等的器具为标准，数其数量的单位。","pronunciation":["잔"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"给予，给","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"82136","definition":"把东西等递给别人，让别人拥有或使用。","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d1a7a276c1dec17aefeb.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n64677-4-7-2","ko":"물은 없고 주스가 있는데 드릴까요?","zh":"没有水，只有果汁，要来点吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"물은","meaning":"水","explanation":"물：水；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"물","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17596","senseId":"1","lemma":"물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물은","audio":"/audio/e2ca40c7661f01e567bc.mp3"}},{"text":"없고","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"1","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없고","audio":"/audio/4efd3b8cd0ddc58fed1a.mp3"}},{"text":"주스가","meaning":"汁，果汁","explanation":"주스：汁，果汁；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"주스","audio":"/audio/63db64644799c8112bf0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26899","senseId":"1","lemma":"주스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주스가","audio":"/audio/4288c4ce01ffd29a59d1.mp3"}},{"text":"있는데","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있는데","audio":"/audio/cef0332a5e3d72106522.mp3"}},{"text":"드릴까요?","meaning":"致，呈，献，奉上","explanation":"드리다：致，呈，献，奉上；ㄹ까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61168","senseId":"1","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"드릴까요","audio":"/audio/235c96fe68d709255264.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2e7edc957ce601f5","term":"물","zh":"水","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3","entryId":"17596","definition":"含在河、湖、海、地下水等，纯粹的且无色无香无味的透明液体。","pronunciation":["물"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"人或事物等实际上不存在。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]},{"id":"63db64644799c811","term":"주스","zh":"汁，果汁","audio":"/audio/63db64644799c8112bf0.mp3","entryId":"26899","definition":"压榨水果或蔬菜而成的汁液；或指用它制成的饮料。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"e583f55bf1cfad46","term":"드리다","zh":"致，呈，献，奉上","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3","entryId":"61168","definition":"(尊称)给。","pronunciation":["드리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0596670e33ce6e6c4fa4.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.4,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=64677","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"4","sourceLevel":"초급","day":39,"sequenceScore":1.7402,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我口渴了，能给我一杯冰水吗？","没有水，只有果汁，要来点吗？","那家店是卖酒的。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我口渴了，能给我一杯冰水吗？","没有水，只有果汁，要来点吗？","那家店是卖酒的。"],"answer":1}]}
